kipai = (t:v) (w:go/set out) (d:pai go with the prefix ki, used impersonally or passively: one goes, people set out; kipai khiatpih, be carried away) (e:a thumna ah ~ hi) (b:pai) (r:11.6.8/4.2.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
