kisuksiat = (t:v) (w:be destroyed/be ruined) (d:passive of suksiat, the form used before khit, loh, nading and similar words) (e:ka tapa a ~ loh nadingin) (b:suksiat) (r:10.14.11/5.12.30) (q:draft)
