laithei = (t:n) (w:scribe/teacher of the law) (d:person who knows letters, a learned man; in the Gospels the teachers of the law) (e:Pasian siampi leh ~ upa teng khawm a) (b:lai) (r:40.2.4/13.2.55) (q:draft)
