henhan = (t:adv) (d:expressive word after a verb for a great noisy mass in motion, as a clamouring crowd or surging waves) (e:mihonpi a gamlum ~ a muh ciangin) (r:40.9.23/26.26.3) (q:draft, low confidence)
huk = (t:v) (w:be in heat/lust) (d:of animals be in heat, of people burn with lust, huk luatna is lust) (e:a thahatzawte a ~ ciangin) (r:1.30.41/24.2.24) (q:draft)
