kihingkiksak = (t:v) (w:be raised to life/be raised from the dead) (d:passive of hingkiksak, make alive again) (e:sihna panin Khrih ~ khin a) (b:hingkiksak) (r:45.6.9/46.15.16) (q:draft)
kikholh = (t:v) (w:associate with/keep company with/mix with) (d:be in the company of others; the other person is marked by tawh with) (e:migilote tawh ~ nuam sa a) (r:18.34.8/46.5.9) (q:draft)
