On = (t:name) (c:city) (w:On) (d:city in Egypt, also called Heliopolis) (e:~ khua siampipa Potifera’ tanu Asenath) (r:1.41.50/26.30.17) (q:draft)
On = (t:name) (c:male) (w:On) (d:son of Peleth, of the tribe of Reuben) (r:4.16.1) (q:draft)
Ono = (t:name) (c:city) (w:Ono) (e:leh ~ khuami za sagih) (r:16.7.37/16.11.35) (q:draft)
