kilamdan = (t:v) (w:differ/be different) (d:be different from one another; in the verses it occurs in the noun kilamdan'na, difference or distinction) (e:a zawng a ~’na om lo hi) (r:20.22.2/39.3.18) (q:draft)
kilawmin = (t:adv) (w:properly/fittingly/decently) (d:kilawm suitable with the suffix in) (e:a ~ na gamtat nading zia) (b:kilawm) (r:20.5.2/45.13.13) (q:draft)
kilhnate = (t:n) (w:clasps/hooks/nails) (d:plural; fasteners that hold things together) (e:~ tawh puante khat leh khat kimatsak hi) (b:kilhna) (r:2.36.13/14.3.9) (q:draft)
kiliah = (t:v) (w:be hidden/be concealed) (d:be out of sight or kept from someone's knowledge; ki with liah cover, hide) (e:nangma kiang pan ~ lo hi) (b:liah) (r:19.69.5/40.5.14) (q:draft)
kima = (t:adj) (w:divorced) (d:of a woman who has been put away by her husband; listed beside meigong widow) (e:meigong ahi a, a ~ ahi zongin) (r:3.22.13/4.30.9) (q:draft)
kimkotin = (t:adv) (w:around/round about) (d:kimkot with the suffix in; after a noun, going or lying all around it) (e:biaknatau ~ pai un) (b:kimkot) (r:19.118.27/7.11.18) (q:draft)
kineihkhemte = (t:n) (w:pretenders/hypocrites/false ones) (d:plural; those who pretend to be what they are not, as in kamsang kineihkhemte false prophets) (e:Kamsang a ~ in leitung thu gen uh a) (b:kineihkhem) (r:62.4.5/41.13.22) (q:draft)
kiniam = (t:v) (w:be brought low/be humbled) (d:ki with niam low; in the verses with koih put, kiniam koih is be brought low) (e:mihaute ~ koih suk hi) (b:niam) (r:21.10.6/19.116.6) (q:draft)
kinin = (t:v) (w:be concerned about/care about/give heed to) (d:kin heed with in; kinin nei is have concern for something) (e:Topa’ thu bek ~ nei uh hi) (b:kin) (r:46.7.32/19.102.17) (q:draft)
kinin = (t:v) (w:defile oneself/become unclean) (d:ki with nin unclean) (e:nomau na ~ tawmsak kei ding uh hi) (b:nin) (r:3.11.43) (q:draft)
kipawlte = (t:n) (w:those who are joined with/associates/companions) (d:people who associate with or belong to someone or something, plural; used with tawh, with) (e:Topa tawh ~ in Topa tawh lungsim khat) (b:kipawl) (r:46.6.17/41.16.10) (q:draft)
kipawlthei = (t:v) (w:be able to associate/can be united) (d:kipawl with thei, be able to join or have fellowship with; in the 1977 text Pasian tawh kipawlthei renders being justified, put right with God) (e:Midik le mimawh bangci-in ~ ding a) (b:kipawl) (r:47.6.14/45.9.30) (q:draft)
kipi = (t:v) (w:marry/take a wife) (d:paired with kiteeng or kiteengsak for marrying and being given in marriage; a kipi mo is a bride being wed) (e:a thokik mite ~ kiteengin a om) (r:42.20.35/66.21.2) (q:draft)
kipuaseh = (t:v) (w:be cut off/be excluded/be banned) (d:be put outside and shut out from a place or a people; in the Psalms of the wicked being cut off) (e:cih leh migilote ~ ding a) (r:19.37.9/14.26.21) (q:draft)
kisangsak = (t:v) (w:be exalted/be lifted up/be made high) (e:mual neute tungah ~ ding hi) (r:23.2.2/19.46.10) (q:draft)
kisehna = (t:n) (w:valuation/value/estimation) (d:the amount at which something is assessed) (e:a ~ banah seh nga suah) (b:kiseh) (r:3.27.13/3.27.25) (q:draft)
kisikcip = (t:v) (w:be trampled/be trodden down/be oppressed) (d:be pressed down underfoot; a kisikcip mite are the downtrodden, the oppressed or humble) (e:A ~ mite zahhuaisak kei in la) (r:19.74.21/23.25.10) (q:draft)
kisimna = (t:n) (w:census/count/numbering/number) (d:the act or result of counting people) (e:hih ~ a masa pen ahi hi) (b:kisim) (r:42.2.2/66.9.16) (q:draft)
kisimna = (t:n) (w:attack/assault) (d:an attack in war, as in gal kisimna; of cities, the attacking of them) (e:Bang tan vei gal ~ ka mu) (r:24.4.21/36.1.16) (q:draft)
kitah = (t:v) (w:be applied/be put to/be used on) (d:of a blade being put to something; mulkiatna kitah lo is no razor shall touch the head) (e:ama lu-ah mulkiatna ~ lo ding hi) (r:9.1.11/4.6.5) (q:draft)
kitah = (t:v) (w:snap/break) (d:of a thread that parts when fire touches it) (e:mei a suk khak ciangin a ~ bangin) (r:7.16.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
kitankhia = (t:v) (w:be redeemed/be ransomed) (d:be bought free by payment) (e:sum pia loin note hong ~ ding hi) (b:tankhia) (r:23.52.3/3.19.20) (q:draft)
kithehthangin = (t:v) (w:being scattered/scattered) (d:form of kithehthang with -in, linking to what follows) (e:Kei kiang panin mite ~) (b:kithehthang) (r:9.13.11/26.6.8) (q:draft)
kithehthangsak = (t:v) (w:scatter/disperse/cause to scatter) (e:ngia in tuute manin a ~ hi) (b:kithehthang) (r:43.10.12/24.31.10) (q:draft)
kithutuak = (t:v) (w:agree/be in agreement/be of one mind) (d:mostly found with lo or kei: disagree, be divided) (e:Judah mite ~ loin a kikhenthang kik) (r:43.10.19/41.14.56) (q:draft)
