tanna = (t:n) (w:cutting/cutting off) (d:tan cut with na: act of cutting; sam at tanna, cutting off the hair, phuk tanna, being cut down) (e:Sam at ~, sam metna) (b:tan) (r:46.11.6/45.11.22) (q:draft)
