sangah = (t:adv) (w:on high/up high) (d:sang high with the place marker ah; kho sangah, up on the stand where a lamp is set) (e:meivak a muh nadingun kho ~ a vak hi) (b:sang) (r:42.11.33/41.4.21) (q:draft, low confidence)
santheih = (t:adj) (w:acceptable/pleasing) (d:that can be accepted; Pasian’ santheih, acceptable to God) (e:Pasian’ ~ biaknate a pia dingin) (r:60.2.5/41.9.49) (q:draft)
santheih = (t:v) (w:accept/be able to accept/receive) (d:take or receive something as good or true) (e:Pasian’ teci panna i ~ ding thupizaw hi) (r:62.5.9/45.15.31) (q:draft)
sapfaia = (t:n) (c:stone) (w:sapphire/lapis lazuli) (d:a blue precious stone; the word is the English sapphire) (e:~ suangmanpha bangin a dum) (r:66.9.17/2.28.18) (q:draft)
satsak = (t:v) (w:have flogged/have beaten) (d:sat beat with sak cause; order someone to be flogged) (e:a ~ khit ciangin singlamteh tungah) (b:sat) (r:40.27.26/43.19.1) (q:draft)
satsak = (t:v) (w:inflame/heat up) (d:of wine heating those who drink it) (e:leenggah zu in amaute a ~ pialpual matengin) (r:23.5.11) (q:draft, low confidence)
