sawlbawk = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:bush/shrub) (d:a low bush or shrub of the open country) (e:~ nuai khatah naupang lawn hi) (r:1.21.15/24.17.6) (q:draft)
sawlbuk = (t:n) (w:booth/temporary shelter/hut) (d:a shelter built of leafy branches, as at the festival of the seventh month) (e:tual-ah ~ lam uh hi) (r:16.8.16/16.8.14) (q:draft)
sawmsimin = (t:v) (w:conspire against/plot against) (d:sawmsim with the linking ending in, plotting against someone and then doing the next action) (e:nasemte in amah ~ ama inn sungah) (b:sawmsim) (r:14.33.24/12.15.30) (q:draft)
sazang = (t:n) (w:flesh/muscle) (d:the flesh or muscle of the body, named beside thagui sinews and vun skin) (e:Thagui leh ~ kong guan ding a) (r:26.37.6/18.40.16) (q:draft)
seelin = (t:v) (w:hide/conceal) (d:seel with the linking ending in, hiding something and then doing the next action) (e:sawmnga-in leihawm sungah ~) (b:seel) (r:11.18.13) (q:draft)
seelin = (t:v) (w:disguise) (d:in meel seelin or mel seelin, hiding the face or appearance, being in disguise) (e:a meel ~ gal sungah kuan hi) (b:seel) (r:11.22.30/9.28.8) (q:draft)
