thalkhau = (t:n) (w:bowstring) (d:the string of a bow, from thal bow and khau cord) (e:a keu nai lo ~ sagih) (r:7.16.8/19.11.2) (q:draft)
thalpi = (t:n) (w:bow) (d:thal with pi great, a bow as a weapon of war) (e:Amah in a ~ kek a) (b:thal) (r:25.3.12/19.46.9) (q:draft)
thamante = (t:n) (w:wages/rewards) (e:a nasep ~ nusia ding a) (b:thaman) (r:18.20.18/1.30.28) (q:draft)
