guat = (t:v) (w:put in/lay on/endow with) (d:put something into or upon a person, as God gives skill, a task or a spirit) (e:Topa in siamna leh pilna a ~ mi) (r:2.36.1/21.1.13) (q:draft, low confidence)
hamphazaw = (t:adj) (w:more fortunate/better off/happier) (d:hampha, fortunate, with zaw, more) (e:a si khinsa mite ~ ka sa hi) (b:hampha) (r:21.4.2/42.11.28) (q:draft)
hankuang = (t:n) (w:coffin/bier) (d:the box or frame on which a dead body is laid and carried) (e:Kumpipa David in ~ zui hi) (r:10.3.31/1.50.26) (q:draft)
