hem = (t:v) (w:be diminished/be impaired) (d:with a negative, not lessened or damaged in any way) (e:ama hoihna bangmah ~ tuan lo hi) (r:18.2.3) (q:draft, low confidence)
hem = (t:n) (w:rumour/hint) (d:in thu hem, a report heard only in part) (e:a thu ~ zak bek ung) (r:18.28.22) (q:draft, low confidence)
