vuuk = (t:n) (w:snow) (e:guahtui leh ~ hong pai-in) (r:23.55.10/40.28.3) (q:draft)
zagukte = (t:num) (w:six hundred) (d:zaguk with plural -te, the six hundred, placed after the noun for a group of people) (e:galhiam a tawi Dan mi ~) (b:zaguk) (r:7.18.16/9.27.2) (q:draft)
zahhuaina = (t:n) (w:shame/disgrace/scorn) (e:Israel tungah ~ ka tungsak a) (b:zahhuai) (r:23.43.28/23.30.3) (q:draft)
zahzahin = (t:adv) (w:as much as/as far as) (d:placed after a verb to mean to the full extent of what is wanted or possible) (e:mite’ deih ~ a hawm uh) (b:zahzah) (r:43.6.11/16.5.8) (q:draft)
zakhin = (t:v) (w:have heard/hear) (d:za hear with khin marking the action as completed) (e:ama hihsa thute ~ uh ahih manin) (b:za) (r:41.3.8/42.1.13) (q:draft)
zaknop = (t:v) (w:want to hear/long to hear) (d:form of za hear with nop want; after a possessive, what someone likes to hear) (e:a ~ uh hangin a za kei) (r:40.13.17/55.4.3) (q:draft)
zalh = (t:v) (w:spread out/stretch out/lay flat) (d:to spread something out flat, used of stretching out the heavens, spreading grain and levelling ridges of soil) (e:ama’ siamna tawh vantung a ~ hi) (r:24.10.12/10.17.19) (q:draft)
zalite = (t:num) (w:four hundred) (d:zali with plural -te, the four hundred, placed after the noun it counts) (e:amah leh mi ~ a delhin paisuak) (b:zali) (r:9.30.10/11.7.42) (q:draft)
zamin = (t:v) (w:reaching out/stretching out) (d:zam reach or stretch out with the linking suffix -in, followed by another verb) (e:a khut tawh ~ kei hong la) (b:zam) (r:19.18.16/50.3.13) (q:draft)
zangkhai = (t:adv) (w:lightly/in vain) (d:literally light, not heavy; before zat use or ngaihsut think it means to treat as unimportant, to misuse or make light of) (e:hong thuhilhna ~ ngaihsut kei inla) (r:58.12.5/5.5.11) (q:draft)
zanuam = (t:v) (w:want to hear/like to hear) (d:za hear with nuam want or like) (e:a thugen ~ veve hi) (r:41.6.20/44.25.22) (q:draft)
zawhgawp = (t:v) (w:overpower/conquer/defeat completely) (d:zawh overcome with gawp marking forceful or thorough action) (e:amah simin a ~ khit ciangin) (b:zawh) (r:42.11.22/66.13.7) (q:draft)
zawhzawh = (t:v) (w:be able to overcome/prevail against) (d:form of zo overcome followed by zo be able, used before loh, lohna or nading) (e:Kuamah in Pasian a ~ lohna) (r:18.9.2/24.31.11) (q:draft)
zawhzawh = (t:v) (w:be able to finish/be able to complete) (d:form of zo finish followed by zo be able) (e:a ~ nading dangka a nei hiam) (r:42.14.28) (q:draft, low confidence)
zawkan = (t:adv) (w:how much more/all the more/even more) (d:placed after a verb in a comparison to say that something applies to an even greater degree; after a negative verb, how much less) (e:hong huam zo lo ~ ding hi) (r:14.6.18/20.15.11) (q:draft)
zeem = (t:v) (w:adorn/decorate/dress up) (d:to make beautiful, used of a building, a tomb, the hair, and of dressing a person in fine clothes) (e:suang manpha phutin a inn ~ hi) (r:14.3.6/40.23.29) (q:draft)
zialzial = (t:adv) (w:flashing/glittering) (d:after tee shine, describes light that flashes again and again like lightning) (e:khuaphia bangin a tee ~ dingin) (r:26.21.10/26.21.28) (q:draft, low confidence)
zialzial = (t:adv) (w:freely/about) (d:after pai go, describes going about freely wherever one wishes) (e:na utna peuhah na pai ~ thei hi) (r:43.21.18) (q:draft, low confidence)
zingtungin = (t:adv) (w:early in the morning/at dawn) (d:zingtung early morning with the marker -in) (e:kimkhatte ~ hanah pai uh) (r:42.24.22/42.24.1) (q:draft)
zintunna = (t:n) (w:lodging/place of stay) (d:the place where a traveller stays as a guest; before inn, mun or pa it means the house, the place or the host where one is staying) (e:ka ~ inn-ah hong tung uh hi) (b:zintun) (r:44.11.11/45.16.23) (q:draft)
zogawpin = (t:v) (w:overpowering/crushing/defeating completely) (d:zogawp defeat utterly with the linking suffix -in, followed by another verb) (e:a gal khempeuh uh ~ a susiamang) (b:zogawp) (r:33.5.9/27.2.44) (q:draft)
zop = (t:v) (w:carry on/continue) (d:form of zom join or continue used before ding, zawh and nading; to carry on a name or go on with a work; zop zawh is be able to carry through, to finish) (e:inn a ~ zawh kei leh) (r:42.14.29/5.25.7) (q:draft)
zop = (t:v) (w:share in/join in) (d:to be joined to something and so have a part in it) (e:eite in i ~ nadingin) (r:58.12.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
zuansak = (t:v) (w:cause to go to/let go to/send to) (d:zuan head for with -sak, to make or allow someone to go to a place or person) (e:na pate kiang nang kong ~ ding) (b:zuan) (r:12.22.20/28.5.4) (q:draft)
zuautatna = (t:n) (w:falsehood/unfaithfulness/treachery/deceit) (d:acting falsely or disloyally, from zuau lie) (e:Hoshea a ~ mu hi) (b:zuautat) (r:12.17.4/45.3.7) (q:draft)
zuihtheih = (t:v) (w:be able to follow/be able to obey) (d:zuih follow or obey with theih can; the form used before nading, so that one may follow or obey) (e:ama khekhap na ~ nadingun) (b:zuih) (r:60.2.21/41.7.9) (q:draft)
zuipah = (t:v) (w:follow at once/follow immediately) (d:zui follow with pah, at once, without delay) (e:Jesuh nung a ~ uh hi) (r:40.20.34/41.1.18) (q:draft)
zuito = (t:v) (w:follow upward/climb after) (d:zui follow with to upward; the opposite is zuisuk, follow downward) (e:Ka nung hong ~ in) (b:zui) (r:9.14.12/20.15.24) (q:draft)
zuizo = (t:v) (w:be able to follow/be able to keep/manage to obey) (d:zui follow or obey with zo be able) (e:mi tawmno bek in a ~ uh hi) (b:zui) (r:40.7.14/43.6.60) (q:draft)
zumhuaipi-in = (t:adv) (w:shamefully/disgracefully) (d:zumhuaipi very shameful with the adverb suffix -in) (e:a ~ a gamta uh hi) (r:45.1.27/18.36.14) (q:draft)
zumsak = (t:v) (w:shame/put to shame/humiliate) (d:zum be ashamed with -sak, to make someone ashamed) (e:Lawpna in hong ~ lo ding hi) (b:zum) (r:45.5.5/46.1.27) (q:draft)
zunekna = (t:n) (w:drinking/wine drinking/drunkenness) (d:the drinking of zu, wine or other alcoholic drink) (e:~ tawh ka lung nuamsakin) (r:21.2.3/60.4.3) (q:draft)
zuthawl = (t:n) (w:betrothal pledge/engagement) (d:pledge given to seal a promise of marriage, literally a flask of zu, rice beer; zuthawl piaksa means pledged to be married, betrothed) (e:Josef a dingin ~ piaksa hi a) (r:40.1.18/42.1.27) (q:draft, low confidence)
